<title>USA: Chrysler Corp may issue $600 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Corp may issue $600 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp is expected to tap the corporate bond new issue market with a $600 million debt offering this week, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of an A3/A-minus rated 30-year issue, sources said.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc is expected to serve as lead underwriter on the offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
